 chief Kate Laswell, Captain John Price rallies the elite special forces of Task Force 141, including Soap, Ghost, and Gaz, to hunt the terrorist down before his plans can unfold. As Makarov sets a chain of attacks in motion across the globe, 141 must forge uneasy alliances and race across continents to stop him and avert catastrophe.", "summary": "The game brings \"open combat, \" offering players more choices in approaching the single-player missions. Makarov returns as the chief villain of the new campaign.\n\nThe newly introduced Carry Forward system will let players keep their progression and inventory from Modern Warfare II. Multiplayer fans can expect 16 maps at the launch and at least 12 coming later. Zombies mode will also return and should offer the largest zombie map to date.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-iii", "videos": [{"id": 95288, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "ITIcmA4Zwa8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITIcmA4Zwa8", "title": "Modern Warfare III is Coming", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ITIcmA4Zwa8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 96161, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "UdvfkYt-8k4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UdvfkYt-8k4", "title": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III Campaign 4K Gameplay Trailer | Gamescom ONL 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UdvfkYt-8k4/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1957, "name": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare"}, {"id": 107, "name": "Call of Duty"}]}